sequenceDiagram
    participant PR as Pull request
    participant Job as Actions job
    participant SG as suite-gate action
    participant Tools as Audit tools
    PR->>Job: pull_request event
    Job->>Job: actions/checkout, fetch-depth 0, read-only token
    Job->>SG: install suite-gate and the audit tools
    SG->>Tools: gate, rules ci: base origin/ + base branch, ref the pull request
    Tools-->>SG: audit-result/1 objects
    SG-->>PR: annotations on file and line (error for fail, warning for warn)
    SG-->>Job: log, job summary, outputs verdict and result
    SG-->>Job: exit 1 on fail, 2 on error, 0 on warn or pass
